WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.379 --> 00:00:03.689
Oh, hello!

00:00:03.689 --> 00:00:05.532
Do you have a warrant to be here?

00:00:09.291 --> 00:00:11.898
Maybe there's a little bit of...

00:00:11.898 --> 00:00:13.860
a little grass growing right along here.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.641
Just some happy little things.

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:17.677
I love you.

00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:19.714
You love me.

00:00:19.714 --> 00:00:22.903
We all own our own bodies.

00:00:22.903 --> 00:00:24.657
So marry who you want,

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:27.258
and do whatever drugs you choose.

00:00:27.258 --> 00:00:28.729
And when it's time,

00:00:28.729 --> 00:00:30.950
you can die with dignity by determining

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.000
your own end of life plan.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.285
Hi Maria!

00:00:34.285 --> 00:00:35.423
Hi Officer Winkles!

00:00:35.423 --> 00:00:36.525
How're you doing today?

00:00:36.525 --> 00:00:38.041
I don't have to answer that question.

00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:39.150
That is correct.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.290
I'm recording you!

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.501
Am I being detained?

00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:42.209
Nope.

00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:45.568
Which I can legally do, because I'm in a public place!

00:00:45.568 --> 00:00:46.920
Come back if you have a warrant.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.899
Alrighty.

00:00:47.899 --> 00:00:49.148
Know your rights.

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:50.625
Yay!

00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:53.546
Okay Gumshoes, Carmen Sandiego is in a country

00:00:53.546 --> 00:00:55.670
where socialism failed.

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:58.970
That narrows it down to Venezuela, Cuba,

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:02.655
the former Soviet Union, Moldova, Laos,

00:01:02.655 --> 00:01:06.063
Vietnam, Albania, Angola—

00:01:06.063 --> 00:01:09.315
So we did some digging into your past.

00:01:16.274 --> 00:01:19.133
The suspense is killing me!

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:21.630
But we still haven't solved the case Holmes!

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:24.580
Why is marijuana a schedule one drug?

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:26.180
Elementary, my dear Watson.

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:28.039
Nixon and racism.

00:01:28.039 --> 00:01:29.704
What?

00:01:29.704 --> 00:01:30.892
You okay?

00:01:30.892 --> 00:01:32.523
I don't know.

00:01:32.523 --> 00:01:35.000
Hey man, it's alright.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.770
It's alright.

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:40.578
We've got qualified immunity.

00:01:40.578 --> 00:01:41.985
Qualified immunity!

00:01:41.985 --> 00:01:43.730
It's not for you, it's just for me.

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:44.599
I shot your dog.

00:01:44.599 --> 00:01:45.729
I shot your wife.

00:01:45.729 --> 00:01:48.000
I get to go on with my life.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.987
My favorite part is where the character says,

00:01:49.987 --> 00:01:51.760
I do not want green eggs and ham.

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.109
And then Sam I Am says,

00:01:53.109 --> 00:01:55.490
That's fine, you don't have to eat them. That's your right.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:56.520
The end.

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.020
It's a short book.

00:01:58.463 --> 00:02:00.900
Here we see one of the last taxi cab monopolies

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.230
struggling for life.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:05.647
Competitors have entered their ecosystem.

00:02:06.735 --> 00:02:10.270
Do you know what eminent domain abuse is?

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:12.760
It's when the government decides the neighborhood of

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:17.760
make-believe is better used by a Taiwanese LCD manufacturer.

00:02:18.109 --> 00:02:19.830
Today we have a real Senator.

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:20.663
Hello Senator!

00:02:20.663 --> 00:02:21.550
How are you doing?

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:22.640
What is your favorite color?

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:23.657
I would have to say blue.

00:02:23.657 --> 00:02:24.841
Me too!

00:02:24.841 --> 00:02:26.810
Tell me, why did you sell all your stock

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.727
right before the crash?

00:02:28.727 --> 00:02:29.940
Um...

00:02:30.707 --> 00:02:35.704
I mean it's literally just the tragedy of the commons, but they made it cute?

00:02:36.287 --> 00:02:39.903
And that sound means we're in international waters,

00:02:39.903 --> 00:02:43.359
I'm gonna marry a robot and sell my kidney on eBay.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:46.980
My dearest Rowena,

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:50.070
today the district attorney filed criminal charges

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:52.292
against a two door sedan.

00:02:52.503 --> 00:02:54.610
Carmen Sandiego is hiding in a country

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.160
that contains an American military base.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.140
Is she in...

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:03.310
Australia, Bahrain, Belgium, Brazil, Bulgaria,

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:04.680
British Indian Ocean Territory,

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.816
Cuba, Germany, Djibouti--

00:03:07.099 --> 00:03:09.418
Clifford the big red—

00:03:09.418 --> 00:03:11.928
menace.

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:13.582
Circle.

00:03:13.582 --> 00:03:14.500
Square.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:15.940
Rectangle.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:18.011
War factory.

00:03:20.707 --> 00:03:22.830
All right Jack, where is your gay wedding cake?

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:24.740
I refuse to bake a gay wedding cake,

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.330
and you can't force me to.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.417
It's my right.

00:03:27.417 --> 00:03:28.350
That is your right.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.590
But it is my right to kick you off of this show.

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:31.423
Please leave.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:33.323
Yup.

00:03:33.323 --> 00:03:35.257
You homophobic bearded meat goblin.

00:03:35.711 --> 00:03:38.550
I just want enough to warm it up some.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:39.960
I don't want to set it on fire.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.918
It's a very easy to set it on fire.

00:03:42.488 --> 00:03:43.491
Well today on This Old House,

00:03:43.491 --> 00:03:45.180
we're at the city zoning office,

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.780
because they think our new porch

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.810
is two inches too close to the sidewalk.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:50.210
Which is (beep) bull (beep),

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:53.100
because their sidewalk is too far away from the street.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.390
Which they'd know about if they'd read any of the e-mails

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:57.290
I'd sent them over the past 18 months.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:02.106
So join us, as we waste our whole (beep) day on this (beep).

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:13.800
The premier of Thomas the High Speed Rail

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.400
has been delayed.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.126
Again.

00:04:16.637 --> 00:04:18.170
And at the ten bitcoin level,

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.547
you receive a handsome tote bag.

00:04:20.831 --> 00:04:21.522
Quack!

00:04:21.522 --> 00:04:22.242
Good one!

00:04:22.242 --> 00:04:23.273
Quiet.

00:04:23.273 --> 00:04:24.292
Very good.

00:04:24.292 --> 00:04:25.435
Queen.

00:04:25.435 --> 00:04:27.686
What else starts with the letter Q?

00:04:27.686 --> 00:04:29.150
Space lasers.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:30.750
Oh, uh.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:33.783
John Podesta and Hilary Clinton

00:04:33.783 --> 00:04:36.322
had an email exchange about hot dogs.

00:04:36.322 --> 00:04:37.673
Where do we get these puppets?

00:04:38.028 --> 00:04:40.340
It's a beautiful day in the neighborhood

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:44.431
and you have a right to defend your house with firearms.

00:04:44.431 --> 00:04:46.397
With firearms.

